      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0055",
      "text": "(pumping chamber, reservoir, relief valve adjusting cap",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 423.506,
        "x1": 546.089,
        "bottom": 432.506
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0056",
      "text": "fitting, etc.) be sure:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 434.256,
        "x1": 396.513,
        "bottom": 443.256
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0057",
      "text": "1. That any pressure in the chamber has been",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 448.606,
        "x1": 509.562,
        "bottom": 457.606
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0058",
      "text": "completely vented through the suction or discharge",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 459.356,
        "x1": 546.048,
        "bottom": 468.356
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0059",
      "text": "lines, or other appropriate openings or connections.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 470.106,
        "x1": 547.551,
        "bottom": 479.106
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0060",
      "text": "2. That the driving means (motor, turbine, engine, etc.)",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 484.456,
        "x1": 541.368,
        "bottom": 493.456
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0061",
      "text": "has been “locked out” or made non-operational, so that",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 495.206,
        "x1": 557.28,
        "bottom": 504.206
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0062",
      "text": "it cannot be started while work is being done on pump.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 505.956,
        "x1": 554.283,
        "bottom": 514.956
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0063",
      "text": "3. That you know what liquid the pump has been handling",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 520.306,
        "x1": 556.452,
        "bottom": 529.306
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0064",
      "text": "and the precautions necessary to safely handle the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 531.056,
        "x1": 538.164,
        "bottom": 540.056
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0065",
      "text": "liquid. Obtain a material safety data sheet (MSDS) for",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 541.806,
        "x1": 545.787,
        "bottom": 550.806
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0066",
      "text": "the liquid to be sure these precautions are understood.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 552.556,
        "x1": 554.697,
        "bottom": 561.556
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0067",
      "text": "Failure to follow above listed precautionary measures",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 567.156,
        "x1": 540.576,
        "bottom": 576.156
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0068",
      "text": "may result in serious injury or death.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 578.156,
        "x1": 468.054,
        "bottom": 587.156
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0069",
      "text": "DISASSEMBLY",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.711,
        "top": 614.012,
        "x1": 399.497,
        "bottom": 626.012
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0070",
      "text": "Mark valve and head before disassembly to ensure proper",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 629.775,
        "x1": 542.601,
        "bottom": 638.775
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0071",
      "text": "reassembly.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 640.525,
        "x1": 358.349,
        "bottom": 649.525
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0072",
      "text": "1. Remove valve cap.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 654.875,
        "x1": 400.527,
        "bottom": 664.334
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0073",
      "text": "2. Measure and record length of extension of adjusting",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 669.225,
        "x1": 531.108,
        "bottom": 678.684
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0074",
      "text": "screw. Refer to “A” on \"Figure 12\" on page 10.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 679.975,
        "x1": 514.091,
        "bottom": 689.434
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0075",
      "text": "Loosen locknut and back out adjusting screw until spring",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 694.325,
        "x1": 549.108,
        "bottom": 703.325
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0076",
      "text": "3.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 694.784,
        "x1": 318.006,
        "bottom": 703.784
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0077",
      "text": "pressure is released.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 705.075,
        "x1": 407.529,
        "bottom": 714.075
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0078",
      "text": "4. Remove bonnet, spring guide, spring and poppet from",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 310.5,
        "top": 719.425,
        "x1": 539.109,
        "bottom": 728.884
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0079",
      "text": "valve body. Clean and inspect all parts for wear or damage",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 730.175,
        "x1": 557.942,
        "bottom": 739.175
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0080",
      "text": "and replace if necessary.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 324.0,
        "top": 740.925,
        "x1": 423.388,
        "bottom": 749.925
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0081",
      "text": "NOTE: 226A SERIES™ & 4226A SERIES™ JACKETED PUMPS DISCONTINUED AS OF 4Q20.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 101.204,
        "top": 755.617,
        "x1": 492.799,
        "bottom": 764.617
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0082",
      "text": "TSM 1600 | Issue C | Page 10 of 20",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 766.925,
        "x1": 188.757,
        "bottom": 776.925
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP021:p0010:b0083",
      "text": "© 2020 Viking Pump, Inc. • Cedar Falls, IA",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 389.303,
        "top": 767.525,
        "x1": 558.494,
        "bottom": 776.525
      },
      "reading_order": 83,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    }
